{
  "_doc": "The M4 Sherman, 75 mm gun. 5.84 m long by 2.62 m wide by 2.74 m tall. A tall hull with a sloped glacis, a bull-nose transmission cover and two driver hatch hoods. A low round cast turret with a small flat mantlet and a short bustle, on the hull centre; the gun barely overhangs the nose. Three bogies of two small wheels a side, a return roller on each, a high front sprocket, the top run dropping to a low rear idler. Olive drab (skin), rubber and dark steel (pale, frame2), worn olive (mark). Track height and top-run width are a little exaggerated to read at game size.",
